{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in the darkness, in a forest where every night, real horror lurks among the trees</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065560/extras/43746021d89964d69d2e9330380ab752.poster.avif?t=1761726303\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065560/extras/43746021d89964d69d2e9330380ab752.webm?t=1761726303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065560/extras/43746021d89964d69d2e9330380ab752.mp4?t=1761726303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of the few who survived the accident, and your task is simple... but terrifying:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive 99 nights: every evening, the darkness grows thicker, the enemies become more dangerous, and resources become scarcer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the forest's lore: collect diaries to uncover the secrets of an ancient cult that once lived here.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight fear, not just monsters: noise attracts danger, light can be a blessing or a curse, footsteps in the dark are louder than screams.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065560/extras/a514f1efea838b79ae5a4f24cff1def8.poster.avif?t=1761726303\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065560/extras/a514f1efea838b79ae5a4f24cff1def8.webm?t=1761726303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065560/extras/a514f1efea838b79ae5a4f24cff1def8.mp4?t=1761726303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperate or survive alone: team up with friends to stop the darkness together... or take on the challenge alone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a camp and defend it from nighttime attacks: a campfire and torch can be your best friends\u2014until they go out...</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4065560?t=1761726303","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4065560?t=1761726303","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065560/d189373c0e94b882237db0a0ffaa6d428a795ed6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761726303","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065560/d189373c0e94b882237db0a0ffaa6d428a795ed6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761726303","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in the darkness, in a forest where every night, real horror lurks among the trees</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065560/extras/43746021d89964d69d2e9330380ab752.poster.avif?t=1761726303\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065560/extras/43746021d89964d69d2e9330380ab752.webm?t=1761726303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea